      "value": "Reproduced after ~43 Reference Companion Cubes and 7 (?) other items.\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1896-3369f677b3-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_18-45-43.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_b5598add-10ed-4a6a-855d-8c40ec6c5907/1/file)\n\n(I couldn't attach the log file directly, too much repetition in the logs which Canny rejects.)",
